    <statement><p>Find an equation for the contour of
<m>f(x, y) = 2 x^2 y + 7 x + 25</m> that goes through the point
<m>(5, -3)</m>.</p>
<p>Equation: <fillin characters="55" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2yx^{2}+7x+25 = -90</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>f(5, -3) = 2\cdot 5^2\cdot -3 + 7 \cdot 5 + 25 =  -90</m>,
an equation for the contour is
<me>2 x^2 y + 7 x + 25 = -90.</me>



</solution>
